Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.33,0:00:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PAINTBALLS FIRING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好险
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:08.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, I love the smell of paintballs in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:08.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我爱早晨彩弹的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, still funny, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀 还是很幽默 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:13.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PAINTBALLS FIRING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No way we can get to the ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没办法到山脊那里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:17.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Chemistry Department has us cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:17.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}化学部门完全阻断我们的路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about the creek bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}河床那里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Pharmacology Department controls that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}药物学部门控制那里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And they're all hopped up on experimental steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们全服用了实验性类固醇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:25.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it then, we're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:25.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难怪 我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Time to acknowledge that we are paying the price...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为是时候承认 我们会付出代价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for some failing to attend Physics Department paintball strategy meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为我们之中有人没有参加 物理部门的彩弹战略会议
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told you, my mom has spider veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你说了 我妈静脉曲张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:38.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to take her to the laser clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:38.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得带她去激光门诊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I told you I wanted to see a doctor's note.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也跟你说过我要看医生证明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need a plan. How about Operation Hammer of the Gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要一个计划 要不要采用〝雷神之锤〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which one is Hammer of the Gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪一个计划是〝雷神之锤〞？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We hide in the parking lot and ambush people when they come to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们躲在停车场的垃圾桶里 等有人来尿尿时伏击他们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:56.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the dumpsters are deep in Astronomy Department territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:56.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 垃圾桶 在天文学部门的地盘深处
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:59.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shouldn't be a problem, Venus is up during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:59.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该不会有问题 今天金星白天会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're probably just all staring at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们可能都在看天空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, what we need now is a tactical retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我们现在需要的 是战术性撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:07.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you see Stargate where they found themselves on a planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:07.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看过《星际奇兵》里 当他们发现自己来到一个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:10.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a culture based loosely on Earth's Athens and Sparta?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:10.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有着类似地球的 雅典和斯巴达古文明吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, Raj and I are gonna burst out the door and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 拉吉和我冲出去 并逃离 霍华德掩护我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:17.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard will cover us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But why don't I run away and you cover me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么不是我先逃 你们来掩护我？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because you chose your mother's veins over victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你选择你妈妈的静脉 而不是胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On three. One, two, three, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}数到三 一二三 走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:28.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL SCREAMING AND PAINTBALLS FIRING]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to take her. It's almost bathing-suit weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:33.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须带她去 天气越来越热了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:35.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PAINTBALLS FIRING]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:37.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HOWARD SHRIEKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I surrender, don't shoot. They went that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我投降 不要射我 他们往那边走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:44.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LESLIE: Howard, I'm on your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:44.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 我跟你一队的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:45.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Leslie, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:45.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你 莱斯丽 谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:49.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where's the rest of your squad? -Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:49.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你其他的队员呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They left me here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们留我在这里等死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:53.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:53.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dead. All of them. -Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-死了 全死了 -抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was friendly fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They just wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们就是不听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们被包围了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:13.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I guess there's nothing for us to do but wait to be captured or killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:13.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我想也不能做什么了 只能等着任人宰割
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:15.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hm. That's the worst part.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:15.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是最糟的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All the while knowing that there's a paint pellet out there with your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道有颗写着你名字的 彩色弹丸在外面等着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:27.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The big wet ball of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:27.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又大又湿的死亡之球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PAINTBALLS SPRAYING SHED]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of makes you feel more alive, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你觉得更激昂 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:36.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It kind of does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:36.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I say we make every moment count.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说我们让每一刻过得有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:45.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How exactly do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:45.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PAINTBALLS FIRING IN DISTANCE]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Howard, why aren't you covering us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你怎么没有掩护我们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're getting slaughtered out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们正惨遭杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}War is hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}战争就是地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you see the new budget memo this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有看到今天早上的 新预算备忘录吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, more cutbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有呀 削减更多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:26.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unacceptable. It baffles me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:26.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真无法接受 这让我很困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:31.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why they don't simply let some of you go so there's money available for my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:31.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为何不干脆开除你们其中几个 就会有更多资金供我研究
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what baffles me, Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道让我困惑的是什么吗？ 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:38.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Based on your academic record, any number of things, I would imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:38.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据你的学术记录 我能想像到很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LESLIE: Hey, guys. -Hi, Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 大家好 -你好 莱斯丽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got the approval for the rapid prototyper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你要的快速原型机 我拿到批准了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's great, Leslie. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 莱斯丽 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You scratch my back, I scratch yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:47.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}礼尚往来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GROWLS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was all that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚刚是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:54.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, uh, no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:54.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They gave Leslie control over some unrestricted grant money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们让莱斯丽掌控一些经费的运用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:02.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, okay, but what's with the back scratching and the meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:02.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那礼尚往来还有叫声 是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe the back-scratching metaphor describes a quid pro quo situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为礼尚往来是在隐喻 一种回报的情形
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where one party provides services to the second party...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当一方提供产品服务给另一方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...in compensation for a similar action. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是为了补偿相似的行为 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:18.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The meow, that sounded to me like an African civet cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:18.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那叫声在我听来像只非洲麝香猫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you done? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说完了没 -还没
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Despite what the name suggests...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管从名字上来看是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:28.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the civet cat is not a true cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:28.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但麝香猫不是真正的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:32.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:32.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我说完了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:37.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I'm thinking Howard wasn't making a back-scratching metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:37.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗 我认为霍华德 没有用你说的隐喻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:40.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm thinking there was some actual scratching involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:40.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得他们两人之间真的有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about it, Howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么回事 霍华德？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I didn't wanna say anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because I know you and Leslie have a little history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我知道你和莱斯丽有段过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:53.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't care about that. -Great, I'm dying to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:53.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不在乎 -太好了 我等不及要说了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and Leslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和莱斯丽？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the paintball shed. Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在彩弹的棚子里 两次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that why you didn't cover our escape and let us get cut down like animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是为什么你没有掩护我们 害我们像动物一样被宰割吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:07.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:07.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:12.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dereliction of duty in the face of the enemy is a court-martial offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:12.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在敌人面前渎职是要受法官审判的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Court martial, schmort martial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}法官审判 管他是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:18.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie Winkle is the fifth girl I've ever had sex with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:18.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽温克尔是有始以来 第五个跟我上床的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:19.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:19.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说 不用花钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And plus you got a rapid prototyper. That's an expensive piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且你还得到了快速原型机 那是一台很贵的仪器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The rest of us have had our budgets cut to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我们其他人的预算却被大大删减
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:33.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, one way to look at this is that I'm getting new equipment and you're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:33.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 从另一个角度看 我得到了新仪器而你们没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and that's unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这很…不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But a better way to look at this is that I'm getting sex and you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但用一个更好的角度来看是 我跟人上床而你们没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是令人快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The whole thing froze. I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}整个都不会动 我不知道是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Calm down. We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冷静点 我们会有办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:49.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can I calm down? I'm gonna lose my shopping cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:49.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么能冷静 我快失去我的购物车了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:53.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's three hours of picking out shoes just shot to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:53.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有三小时可以疯狂地挑鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:56.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello, Penny. -Hello, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:56.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 佩妮 -你好 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're in my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你占了我的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:02.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you planning on sitting here? -No, I'm going to the comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:02.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有打算要坐在这里吗？ -不 我要去漫画书店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What difference does it make? -What difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那有什么关系？ -那有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In an ever-changing world, it is a single point of consistency.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在一个持续变化的世界 那是一个一致的单一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:15.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If my life were expressed as a function...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我的人生用一个函数来表达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:18.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on a four-dimensional Cartesian coordinate system...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:18.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在一个四度空间的 直角座标系上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:23.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that spot at the moment I first sat on it would be zero, zero, zero, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:23.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那位子在我第一次坐下的时候 就是0000
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't sit in his spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要坐他的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:33.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[EXHALES SHARPLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 开心了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:38.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:38.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:46.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, I love him, but he is one serious whackadoodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:46.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我爱他 但他真是疯到家了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 这样应该可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:50.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, thank you. You are a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:50.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 你是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a lot of shoes you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你订的鞋子真多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you know the sad thing is, it's really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀 但你知道不幸的是 其实那很少
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, is this one of those paintball guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是彩弹枪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You ought to come with us sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀 你偶尔该跟我们一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, thanks. I'm from Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 谢了 我来自内布拉斯加
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When we shoot things, we wanna eat them...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们射东西是为了要吃他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or make them leave our boyfriends alone. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是要她们离我们的男朋友远一点
