Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, your heart's racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 你的心跳好快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I must have really gotten you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定是因为我
