Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:44.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I assume that you've likewise found the experience...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:44.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以认为你也觉得这种体验…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Satisfactory?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很满意？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That wasn't quite the word I was looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是我要说的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.01,0:07:52.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but sure, I'll do this pass-fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.01,0:07:52.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但当然 当成是考试也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, are you enjoying that prototyper I got you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你还喜欢我给你的原型机吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:08:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's great. Everybody in the Engineering Department is eating their hearts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:08:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒 所有工程部的人都羡慕死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't it nice when your good fortune makes others miserable?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得把自己的快乐 建筑在别人的痛苦上很棒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, most people don't get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗 大部分的人都不懂
