Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:24.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm busy, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:24.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在忙 妈
