Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:41.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, there's the arrhythmia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:41.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心律不整了
