Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是犹太人吗？ -不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
