Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no, you had your chance to be "we" for like a year and a half now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…曾有机会可以是我们 快一年半了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right now, you are you, and you are screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在 你是你 而且你完了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why do we have to tell him I did it? -Not gonna tell him I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么一定要跟他说是我做的 -绝对不可能说是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay, how about this?
