Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:38.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We tell him somebody broke in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:38.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们告诉他有人闯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:43.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just to shoot the couch with a paintball gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:43.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就为了拿彩弹枪射沙发？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I buy it. All those people are on drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 我就会相信这些人都吸毒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:51.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could tell him they wanted the couch to stay away from their boyfriend.
