Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, fine. Well, what if we just flip it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 好吧 如果我们直接翻过来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:00.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There. Looks fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:00.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样 看起来很好 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:04.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Butt print. There's no discernible butt print.
