Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:33.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你走着去的？天气有点冷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Koothrappali picked me up. -Isn't that terrific?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是库萨帕里载我的 -这样不是很棒吗？
