Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, but the problem is not solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 但问题没有解决
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If your head had been accidentally amputated...
