Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我们用狗的头移植上去 问题就解决了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:21.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would that be "problem solved"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:23.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it were your head, it would be.
