Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:36.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, sorry, I didn't really think that through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:36.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀 抱歉 我没有考虑周全
