Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:44.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not a full-time dry cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:44.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不是全职的干洗店员
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:47.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He also makes keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:47.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还兼做打钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:49.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, for God's sake, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:49.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行行好 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:50.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Focus is important.
