Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有个女人在等着跟我做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你了解的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:41.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:41.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 一点也不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:43.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nevertheless, I must depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:43.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管如此 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:47.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, did I tell you Leslie pulled strings and got me on the trip to Geneva...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:47.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 我有告诉你们莱斯丽透过 关系 让我参加日内瓦的研究行程
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:49.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to check out the CERN super collider?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:49.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}参观欧洲核子研究组织的 超大型加速器吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not fair. You're not even a physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不公平 你又不是物理学者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:54.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are two ways of looking at this--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:54.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有两个看这件事的角度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:56.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Get out. -Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:56.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快走 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:01.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're improving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:01.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你进步了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:07.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It helps when I get to practice with a real woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:07.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟真正的女人练习有帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, listen. Saturday, my sister's getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 听我说 我姐姐星期六要结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to come with me. It's black tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你跟我一起去 穿正式一点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, gee, I'd really rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我觉得不要去比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么不？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:24.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I go to weddings it's to scam on chunky bridesmaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:24.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我参加婚礼都是去诈骗矮胖的伴娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:27.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what I would do with a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:27.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道若跟约会对象一起去 该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:32.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:32.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:37.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I'm really sorry about that Geneva trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:37.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 我真的很抱歉有关日内瓦之行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What about it? -Oh, didn't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了 -你没听说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to reduce the number of people going and you didn't make the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须删减一些人数 而你被删掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:45.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:45.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是什么时候的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:47.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About 12 seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:47.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大约十二秒之前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:54.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on. Are you saying if I don't go to the wedding, I can't go to Geneva?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:54.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 你是说如果我不去婚礼 就不能去日内瓦了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:57.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, actually, I'm trying not to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:57.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 我试着不要说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:01.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm sorry, but that makes me a little uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:01.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我很抱歉 但这让我有点不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:04.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How so? -Because it's like you're controlling me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:04.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么会？ -因为这样好像你是在控制我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:07.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with new equipment and research trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:07.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用新设备和研究行程
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:11.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I weren't controlling you with equipment and trips, I'd be uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:11.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我不用设备和研究行程 来控制你 我会不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:13.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How so? -Because we'd be in a real relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:13.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么会？ -因为这样好像真的在谈恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:16.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with feelings and all that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:16.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有感情和其它的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:24.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So bottom line, I'm just a bought-and-paid-for sex toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:24.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以说到底 我只是花钱买来的性爱玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 不 一点也不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're also arm candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也是个男伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以 你觉得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:39.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Ma, you gotta rent me a tux!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:39.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 你得帮我租一套礼服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:46.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What kind of sex are you having up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:46.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们现在玩的是哪一招？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you crouching there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要蹲在那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:58.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:58.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where else am I supposed to crouch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还能蹲在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:02.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:05.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:05.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 德州吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:10.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here. Fresh from the cleaners. Good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:10.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洗好了 刚从洗衣店拿来的 跟新的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Great. Sheldon, look. Good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？太好了 谢尔顿 你看 跟新的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:15.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From that key maker? I highly doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:15.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个打钥匙的洗的？我高度怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:19.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Sheldon. Just give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:19.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样 谢尔顿 试试看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:29.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There. Nice and comfy-cozy. Zero, zero, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:29.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 又好又舒适的000
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:32.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's one more zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:32.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少了一个0
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:35.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You forgot the time parameter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:35.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘了时间参数
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sit on the damn couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐到那该死的沙发上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you mean "nope"? What's wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行是什么意思 哪里不对劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing, it's what's wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么 是他不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's exactly the same-- -Penny, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是同一个… -佩妮 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:13.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:13.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I have some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我有坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:18.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:18.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.31,0:18:20.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.31,0:18:20.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恐怕是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:23.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know the cashew chicken I get you on Monday nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:23.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得我星期一晚上 给你的腰果鸡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:24.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, from Szechwan Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:24.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得 是老四川餐馆的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:28.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Szechwan Palace closed two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:28.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老四川餐馆已经关店两年了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:36.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where did my cashew chicken come from? -Golden Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:36.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那我的腰果鸡是哪里来的？ -金龙餐馆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:43.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:43.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, this isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, our food always comes in Szechwan Palace containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我们的食物都是用 老四川餐馆的盒子送来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:56.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, before they went out of business, I bought 4000 containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:56.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 在他们歇业前 我跟他们买了四千盒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:19:00.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I keep them in the trunk of my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:19:00.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我存放在后车箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:02.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:02.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, this changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这改变了所有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought that might take his mind off the cushion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也许会让他不要再想垫子的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:13.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's real? What isn't? How can I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:13.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么是真实的 而什么不是 我该如何知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:18.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You did make that up, right? -Oh, God, I wish I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:18.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是编出来的吧？ -天啊 最好我编得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard? -Yeah, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德？ -怎么了 伙伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still don't like this cushion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是不喜欢这个垫子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:29.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, first of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:29.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 首先
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...Penny, thank you for coming. -Oh, thanks for the shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 谢谢你的加入 -谢谢你鞋子的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:36.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny is an amazing shot. I think we have a chance to win this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:36.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮是很厉害的射击手 我认为我们这星期有机会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the plan? -Okay. Now, we all run out...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-计划是什么？ -好 现在 我们全冲出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:42.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Sheldon and I will cut to the left behind these trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:42.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿和我会切入左边树后面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:45.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, Howard and Leslie flank to the right behind the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:45.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 霍华德和莱斯丽 从侧面到石头的正后方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:48.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll all have a great view as Penny runs out and kills everyone in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:48.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当佩妮冲出去杀死所有人时 我们都可以看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.15,0:19:51.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, just one thing before we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.15,0:19:51.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 在我们开始前还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:53.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it, Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:53.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事 谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:54.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:57.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:57.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:00.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was for my cushion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:00.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}替我的垫子报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, Penny was our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 佩妮是我们唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:08.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, Leonard. But revenge is a dish best served cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:08.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉 莱纳德 但是复仇最好是冷酷无情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She can't shoot me. She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不能射我 她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:18.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's right. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:18.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说得对 你不能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:28.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if we're going to descend into anarchy....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:28.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果要陷入混乱的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.61,0:20:34.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.61,0:20:34.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:40.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Surrender, then Denny's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:40.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}投降然后去吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 杨博
